          "private_evaluator_commitment": "58292a4d5d9a15225b906d53d99129bb6cfde8ea2377691655d5a378e2703a35",
          "task": "Repair the supplied source files to satisfy every public requirement below.\nPreserve public signatures unless a requirement explicitly says otherwise.\n\n[R1] Catalog publishes independent JSON-like non-null records by tenant and SKU. get returns the latest published value for that tenant/SKU regardless of the order other tenants or SKUs are queried. Unknown records raise KeyError. Public method signatures remain unchanged.\n[R2] A publish becomes visible on the next get even while earlier results remain within cache lifetime. Advancing time beyond cache lifetime must not alter the logical record. There is no required internal cache key or revision allocation scheme.\n[R3] Caller mutations to published records and to values returned by get must not change subsequently returned records. Inputs to this task are valid strings and JSON-like values; times are nondecreasing."
        }
