          "task": "Repair the supplied source files to satisfy every public requirement below.\nPreserve public signatures unless a requirement explicitly says otherwise.\n\n[R1] Transactions.begin returns a string-value snapshot. commit(base,changes) is optimistic: reject False atomically if any changed key has changed since base; otherwise apply just changes and return True. Concurrent changes to disjoint keys must survive. Inputs contain no null values and snapshots are not modified by callers. records.values exposes committed state. This contract compares values, not revision tokens; ABA prevention is not required."
